# #️ ohash

<!-- automd:badges bundlephobia codecov -->

[![npm version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/ohash)](https://npmjs.com/package/ohash)
[![npm downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/ohash)](https://npm.chart.dev/ohash)
